This is a demonstration of a proposed template for vertical timelines. It needs no JavaScript: it is wikitext plus TemplateStyles, and it follows the reader's light or dark theme. Source and a live prototype: https://github.com/psygo/wikipedia_timeline (prototype at https://psygo.github.io/wikipedia_timeline/). The sample content is only there to show the layout; check any dates before reusing them.

